        Physical ESP32-S3 GPIO connected to the onboard addressable RGB LED data
        input. The UICPAL ESP32-S3-N16R8 board variant used by this firmware
        uses GPIO48 for its WS2812 RGB LED. Other ESP32-S3 dev boards may use
        GPIO33 or another pin, so verify your board schematic before enabling
        this option on non-UICPAL hardware. Set to -1 to leave the indicator
        disabled even when this menu section is enabled.

