    int "Wi-Fi Remote ID channel"
    default 6
    range 1 13
    help
        2.4 GHz Wi-Fi channel used for Wi-Fi Remote ID transmission. Channel
        6 is the standard/default channel for ASTM F3411 Wi-Fi Beacon/NAN on
